#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/timeseries.md:1
msgid "Time Series Analysis"
msgstr "时间序列分析"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/timeseries.md:7
msgid ""
"`TimeSeriesAnalyzer` is the link between \"N dates of downloaded bands\" and"
" actual time-series analysis: automated per-date index computation, per-"
"pixel trend fitting, zonal time series extraction, and anomaly detection. "
"Not wired into `PyGeoFetch` — always a standalone import."
msgstr ""
"`TimeSeriesAnalyzer` 是“N "
"个日期的已下载波段”与实际时间序列分析之间的桥梁：自动逐日期计算指数、逐像元趋势拟合、分区时间序列提取和异常检测。它没有接入 "
"`PyGeoFetch`——始终需要作为独立模块导入。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/timeseries.md:27
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/timeseries.md:29
msgid ""
"A single image shows a moment; a series shows change. The time-series "
"analyser turns a set of dated rasters into a stack and answers the common "
"questions about it: how fast is each pixel changing, how does a field or "
"district behave through time, and which dates deviate from what is normal. "
"It computes the chosen index for every date, aligns the grids so that the "
"dates can be compared pixel by pixel, and then offers trend fitting, zonal "
"series and anomaly detection on the stack."
msgstr ""
"单幅影像展示的是某一时刻；时间序列展示的则是变化。时间序列分析器把一组带日期的栅格转换为堆栈，并回答有关它的常见问题：每个像元变化有多快，某块农田或某个行政区随时间表现如何，以及哪些日期偏离了正常状态。它会为每个日期计算所选指数，对齐网格以便逐像元比较各日期，然后对堆栈提供趋势拟合、分区序列和异常检测功能。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/timeseries.md:31
msgid ""
"Plan the inputs before you run it. Use the same season each year when you "
"want to compare years, so that the natural annual cycle does not swamp the "
"signal, and keep the same sensor and processing level where you can. The "
"trend map the analyser produces has the same form as the vegetation trend "
"shown in the [Obuasi case study](../../workflows/case-studies.md), with the "
"slope of each pixel in index units per year."
msgstr ""
"运行之前请先规划好输入。如果要比较不同年份，请每年使用同一季节，这样自然的年周期就不会淹没信号，并尽可能保持相同的传感器和处理级别。分析器生成的趋势图与"
" [Obuasi 案例研究](../../workflows/case-studies.md) "
"中展示的植被趋势形式相同，每个像元的斜率以每年的指数单位表示。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/timeseries.md:33
msgid "`build_index_stack()`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/timeseries.md:39
msgid ""
"Computes the configured index for every date (via the standalone "
"`SpectralIndex` class internally — see [Spectral Indices](spectral-"
"indices.md) for how that differs from `client.indices`) and stacks the "
"results into a single `(time, H, W)` array with georeferencing preserved."
msgstr ""
"为每个日期计算所配置的指数（内部通过独立的 `SpectralIndex` 类完成——它与 `client.indices` 的区别参见 "
"[光谱指数](spectral-indices.md)），并将结果堆叠为一个 `(time, H, W)` 数组，同时保留地理配准信息。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/timeseries.md:44
msgid ""
"**`date_bands`**: `{date_string: {band_name: path}}` normally, or — if "
"`precomputed=True` — `{date_string: single_raster_path}` when you already "
"have per-date index rasters and just want them stacked with the profile "
"preserved for later zonal use."
msgstr ""
"**`date_bands`**：通常为 `{date_string: {band_name: path}}`；或者，如果 "
"`precomputed=True`，则为 `{date_string: "
"single_raster_path}`——适用于你已有逐日期的指数栅格、只想将它们堆叠起来并保留 profile 以便后续做分区分析的情况。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/timeseries.md:48
msgid ""
"**`align_grids`** (default `True`): if a date's raster doesn't share the "
"first date's grid (different shape, transform, or CRS), reproject it onto "
"the first date's grid automatically rather than raising. This is a common "
"case — different acquisitions of the same AOI can come from different scene "
"footprints (tile boundaries, orbit tracks), especially for elongated or "
"irregular AOIs, and end up with slightly different pixel grids after "
"clipping even though they cover nearly the same area. Set `False` to restore"
" strict behavior (raise on any mismatch)."
msgstr ""
"**`align_grids`**（默认 `True`）：如果某个日期的栅格与第一个日期的网格不一致（形状、变换或 CRS "
"不同），会自动将其重投影到第一个日期的网格上，而不是抛出错误。这是很常见的情况：同一 AOI "
"的不同次采集可能来自不同的场景覆盖范围（图幅边界、轨道轨迹），尤其是对于细长或不规则的 AOI，裁剪后即使覆盖的区域几乎相同，像元网格也会略有差异。设为"
" `False` 可恢复严格行为（任何不一致都会抛出错误）。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/timeseries.md:58
msgid ""
"Returns an `IndexTimeStack` — sorted by date, with the building blocks the "
"rest of this page's methods operate on."
msgstr "返回一个 `IndexTimeStack`——按日期排序，并带有本页其余方法所操作的基础构件。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/timeseries.md:61
msgid "`IndexTimeStack`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/optical/timeseries.md:72
msgid ""
"`as_xarray()` preserves CRS and transform as attrs (and a pandas-datetime "
"time coordinate) — the related "
"`pygeofetch.processor.stacker.BandStacker.time_stack()` utility produces a "
"similar-looking xarray stack but only preserves `attrs.source_files`, not "
"full georeferencing, so it isn't a substitute when you need the "
"CRS/transform downstream (e.g. for `zonal_timeseries()`)."
msgstr ""
"`as_xarray()` 会将 CRS 和变换保留为 attrs（以及 pandas 日期时间的时间坐标）——相关的 "
"`pygeofetch.processor.stacker.BandStacker.time_stack()` 工具会生成外观相似的 xarray "
"堆栈，但只保留 `attrs.source_files`，而不保留完整的地理配准信息，因此当下游需要 CRS/变换时（例如用于 "
"`zonal_timeseries()`），它不能作为替代。"

